      "contextAfter": "Set the entitlements in your property list for [`5G Network Slicing App Category`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/BundleResources/Entitlements/com.apple.developer.networking.slicing.appcategory) and [`5G Network Slicing Traffic Category`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/BundleResources/Entitlements/com.apple.developer.networking.slicing.trafficcategory). If you don’t entitle your app by specifying both these entitlements, your apps network connections won’t be using Cellular Network Slicing, even if supported by the carrier.",
